# Test 1: the deck's original model, in which a single commander role (#001)
# is lost by Jones and gained by Smith, so that it inheres in both.
# With BFO 2020 as published this is CONSISTENT (BFO states the one-bearer
# rule only in its axioms, not in OWL). With the proposed ODP-002 fix
# (proposal-functional-inherence.ttl) it is INCONSISTENT, as it should be.
@prefix ex:  <https://example.org/command/> .
@prefix obo: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://example.org/command/test-one-role> a owl:Ontology .
ex:jonesCommanderRole obo:BFO_0000197 ex:smith .
